$\begin{align}
x&=\dfrac{-\blueD{b} \pm \sqrt{\blueD{b}^2-4\greenD{a}\purpleC{c}}}{2\greenD{a}}
\\\\
x&=\dfrac{-(\blueD{2}) \pm \sqrt{(\blueD{2})^2-4(\greenD{1})(\purpleC{-15})}}{2(\greenD{1})}
\\\\
x&=\dfrac{-2 \pm \sqrt{4-(-60)}}{2}
\\\\
x&=\dfrac{-2 \pm \sqrt{64}}{2}
\\\\
x&=\dfrac{-2 \pm 8}{2}
\\\\
&x=\dfrac{-10}{2}\text{ or }x=\dfrac{6}{2}
\\\\
&x=-5\text{ or }x=3
\end{align}$
